5,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I need to check the badge records and the morning routine upstairs. My gaps are tiny, so I can’t afford any extra delays during the move.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I’m concerned about the budget. I’ll check the floor billing basis and the facilities quote for re-running power.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I’ll review the drawn plan against the staff survey and the unplanned seat shuffles. We need to see if the current layout actually matches what people reported needing.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Comfort is the only metric that matters. I’ll check the sound meter readings and the physio’s note.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want to see what the new joiners reported and check the unplanned shuffles. Let’s make sure we’re not just repeating old mistakes!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if the power rerun takes days, my gaps vanish. How long does that actually take?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I don’t have the quote yet. But if it delays your routine, we should consider a phased approach to minimize disruption.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, delays are manageable. But @Toshio, if we phase it, who sits in the temporary, worse spots? We need to decide that explicitly now.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
